WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.590
Every year, an Arctic tern flies
from the Arctic to the Antarctic,

2
00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:05.970
and back again.

3
00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:09.810
A honeybee worker flies from
the hive to flowers and back,

4
00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.630
again and again.

5
00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:15.750
Moving the whole body from place
to place like this costs energy.

6
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.120
So what makes it worth an
animal's while to move at all?

7
00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:23.680
In this mission, you'll weigh what
moving costs against what it might bring.

8
00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:28.070
Then you'll judge animals on the move,
and decide whether each move is worth its

9
00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:29.140
cost.

10
00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:33.800
Your mission: find out what makes it
worth an animal's while to move at all.
